        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRBEL, Circulaire Rose with Bellagio Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bellagio Lever with Circulaire Rose has a classic, traditional style that is ideal for historic homes, or homes that are well-suited to an elegant look. This simple style is not pedestrian. It is at the top of the design world in terms of style and popularity. The Grandeur CIRBEL Circulaire Rose with Bellagio Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRBEL Circulaire Rosette with Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Circulaire Collection Bellagio Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRBEL-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262386\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CIRBEL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Bellagio Lever with Circulaire Rose",
                "description": "The Bellagio Lever with Circulaire Rose has a classic, traditional style that is ideal for historic homes, or homes that are well-suited to an elegant look. This simple style is not pedestrian. It is at the top of the design world in terms of style and popularity. The Grandeur CIRBEL Circulaire Rose with Bellagio Lever is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
